    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It all started when my parents passed away when I was a little kid. Early on I had to work for a living, and had a really hard time.",
      "translation" : "這一切都要從我小時候父母去世說起。我很早就得靠工作謀生，日子過得非常艱難。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've worked for 10 years in hopes of buying my dream house where I could find some sense of peace and comfort again. Eventually I thought I had enough zeny to afford my very own sweet home.",
      "translation" : "為了買下一棟能讓我重新感到安寧舒適的理想住宅，我努力工作了10年。後來我以為自己攢夠了澤尼，終於能擁有溫馨的家。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately I didn't have enough money to buy the nice house that I had my eye on. But then, I found this house, which was bigger and cheaper than the first. I bought it without thinking...",
      "translation" : "很遺憾，我的錢不夠買中意的那棟房子。後來我發現這棟房子更大也更便宜，沒多想就買了下來..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sweet Jesus! Turns out, it's a Heaven for Thief Bugs!!!",
      "translation" : "天哪！沒想到這裡竟是盜蟲的天堂！！！"
    },
