      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I tried to do everything I could do. I coaxed them, killed them, but it only brought peace for a moment! I even tried to burn this house down...!",
      "translation" : "我什麼辦法都試過了。哄過它們，也殺過它們，可只能換來片刻安寧！我甚至想過燒掉這棟房子...！"
    },
