      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Gasp* I mean, really, do I need ^3355FF Ora Ora^000000 to get rid of them? People say it is very rarely seen in distant countries.",
      "translation" : "*喘氣*我是說，我真的需要^3355FF奧拉奧拉^000000才能趕走它們嗎？聽說那東西在遙遠的國度也很罕見。"
